<title>USA: Doubletree in OfficeMax alliance.</title>
<headline>Doubletree in OfficeMax alliance.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Doubletree Corp said Thursday it has formed a strategic alliance with OfficeMax Inc to offer business services to guests at Club Hotels by Doubletree.</p>
<p>The company said OfficeMax will equip each hotel's business club room with equipment and supplies, such as printers, photo copiers and fax machines.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
